     "date": "2026-10-03T11:52:30Z",
     "email": "carlton.gibson@noumenal.es",
     "name": "Carlton Gibson"
    },
    "message": "Escape LinkWidget values.\n\nFilter choices are under developer control, and applications\npopulating them from user-supplied values, including via\n``AllValuesFilter``, must filter those appropriately, as always.\nNonetheless, escaping labels by default serves as defense-in-depth\nhardening. Apply ``mark_safe()`` to labels intended to contain HTML.\n\nThanks to Sanjeev Kumar for the report.",
    "tree": {
